Template: apt-repo-vitexsoftware/components
Type: multiselect
Choices: main, backports, games
Default: main, backports, games
Description: VitexSoftware repository components to enable:
 Select which components of the VitexSoftware APT repository to activate.
 .
  * main      — core VitexSoftware packages
  * backports — packages backported from newer Debian releases
  * games     — game packages

Template: apt-repo-vitexsoftware/borrow
Type: boolean
Default: true
Description: Enable the 'borrow' suite?
 The borrow suite provides additional VitexSoftware packages that are not
 tied to a specific Debian release codename.
